// C9 bulbs on a Halloween string: painted glass on a black socket.
// lit: filament hot spot G5, halo drawn for an N1 background (PAL-6).
// warm: the 0.2 s an incandescent filament takes to heat or cool.
// off: dark glass with one moonlit glint.
// a/b/c: one 12 s cycle each, dark at 0.8-2.2 s, 4.8-5.7 s and 8.4-10.2 s,
// so with all three started together only one bulb is dark at a time.
// show: exactly 6 s, for the looping share video; start each bulb 2 s
// after the previous one so only one bulb is dark at a time.
// Origin is relative to one wire segment.
size 9x11
origin 7 5

frame orange-lit
...###...
...#=#...
..w###w..
..wasaw..
.wasfsaw.
.wsfhfsw.
.wasfsaw.
..wasaw..
..wasaw..
...waw...
....w....

frame orange-warm
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...rar...
..radar..
..adgda..
..radar..
...rar...
...rar...
....r....
.........

frame orange-off
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...wew...
..w+eew..
..weeew..
..weeew..
...wew...
...wew...
....w....
.........

frame purple-lit
...###...
...#=#...
..=###=..
..=+p+=..
.=+pPp+=.
.=pPhPp=.
.=+pPp+=.
..=+p+=..
..=+p+=..
...=+=...
....=....

frame purple-warm
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...+p+...
..+pPp+..
..pPgPp..
..+pPp+..
...+p+...
...+p+...
....+....
.........

frame purple-off
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...;=;...
..;*==;..
..;=+=;..
..;===;..
...;=;...
...;=;...
....;....
.........

frame green-lit
...###...
...#=#...
..u###u..
..uuiuu..
.uuioiuu.
.uiohoiu.
.uuioiuu.
..uuiuu..
..uuiuu..
...uuu...
....u....

frame green-warm
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...uiu...
..uioiu..
..iogoi..
..uioiu..
...uiu...
...uiu...
....u....
.........

frame green-off
...###...
...#=#...
...###...
...;u;...
..;*uu;..
..;uuu;..
..;uuu;..
...;u;...
...;u;...
....;....
.........

tag orange-a loop orange-lit:600 orange-warm:200 orange-off:1400 orange-warm:200 orange-lit:9600
tag orange-b loop orange-lit:4600 orange-warm:200 orange-off:900 orange-warm:200 orange-lit:6100
tag orange-c loop orange-lit:8200 orange-warm:180 orange-off:1800 orange-warm:180 orange-lit:1640
tag orange-steady loop orange-lit:1000
tag orange-show loop orange-lit:4000 orange-warm:200 orange-off:1600 orange-warm:200
tag purple-a loop purple-lit:600 purple-warm:200 purple-off:1400 purple-warm:200 purple-lit:9600
tag purple-b loop purple-lit:4600 purple-warm:200 purple-off:900 purple-warm:200 purple-lit:6100
tag purple-c loop purple-lit:8200 purple-warm:180 purple-off:1800 purple-warm:180 purple-lit:1640
tag purple-steady loop purple-lit:1000
tag purple-show loop purple-lit:4000 purple-warm:200 purple-off:1600 purple-warm:200
tag green-a loop green-lit:600 green-warm:200 green-off:1400 green-warm:200 green-lit:9600
tag green-b loop green-lit:4600 green-warm:200 green-off:900 green-warm:200 green-lit:6100
tag green-c loop green-lit:8200 green-warm:180 green-off:1800 green-warm:180 green-lit:1640
tag green-steady loop green-lit:1000
tag green-show loop green-lit:4000 green-warm:200 green-off:1600 green-warm:200
